No, I can't stop my arms from shaking.

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:54.330
Yuno, that's a great effect.

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:56.840
I turned your drawing in.

00:03:58.340 --> 00:03:59.960
Thank you, Miya.

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:04.260
But that unfinished drawing
is up for display as is.

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:09.100
I thought I could pull it off if I worked hard
until the morning, but I fell asleep.

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:11.060
I fell asleep.

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:11.060
I fell asleep...

00:04:12.180 --> 00:04:14.690
