00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:56.350
but the principal said absolutely not.

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:59.610
I can still hear the applause.

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:02.780
Yeah, the hall was packed with guests.

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:06.110
