00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:07.990
Good work.

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:09.280
Hiro!

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:12.240
Miya, Yuno, both of you did a great job.

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:17.960
Thank you very much.
Is your play already over?

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:19.790
Yeah, it was the first show this morning.

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:20.710
Darn. So, how was it?

00:05:20.710 --> 00:05:22.420
Where's Sae?
Darn. So, how was it?

00:05:26.170 --> 00:05:29.260
Didn't I tell you to watch your back?

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:31.680
It was a huge hit.

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:34.850
Yuno, Miya, do you have any plans afterwards?

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:37.230
If not, you wanna hit the kiosk?

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:38.560
Thanks for treating me.

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:40.690
No, I didn't say I would.

00:05:40.810 --> 00:05:42.440
Well, I...

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:46.150
After eating, we can relax and spend this
afternoon checking out the presentation.

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:49.110
Presentation, presentation... presentation...

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:51.580
I want to eat with them, but...

00:05:52.370 --> 00:05:56.830
Sorry, but I have to check out
the presentation now.

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:57.460
Really?
Sorry, but I have to check out
the presentation now.

