Art Class Individual Presentations

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:19.850
So, I'm finally here.

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:21.730
I want to see it now, but I don't...

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:22.520
I want to see it now, but I don't...

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:26.690
But... but still...

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:29.030
Umm...

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:30.660
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:41.250
I wish I had finished it,
but kinda forgot because I was so sleepy.

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:41.960
Preparing for the Festival
1-A Art Department Yuno

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:46.300
Just kidding! I wasn't hoping for that.

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:49.840
Preparing for the Festival. I get it.

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:51.390
Ms. Yoshinoya...

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:53.430
It's a wonderful piece.

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:55.970
But the bottom part of the drawing...

00:06:57.020 --> 00:07:01.400
This blank space is expressing you,
the artist. Isn't that right?

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:06.610
That's also a part of preparation.
That's wonderful.

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:09.990
You are regarding me too highly. Sorry...

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:16.910
No matter how others interpret this,
to me, it's still incomplete.

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:20.410
I couldn't finish what I wanted to draw.

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:22.750
So disappointing...

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:25.130
I'll finish it when the presentation is over.

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:28.800
But I should remember this feeling of anguish.

00:07:29.550 --> 00:07:33.800
I'm sure this experience will help me grow.

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:36.640
Is that an elementary school kid?

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:39.390
No, she's wearing the same jacket.

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:43.350
I like this drawing. It's so Yunocchi.

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:44.560
Miya!

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:47.770
I like the idea of drawing everyone
preparing for the festival.

00:07:48.020 --> 00:07:49.900
That point of view shows your kind side.

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:50.860
Miya...

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:53.530
And this blank part is important.

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:55.530
I see why you left it blank. If you finish it,
it wouldn't be ''preparation.''

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:59.370
Well, actually that's... ummm....
I see why you left it blank. If you finish it,
it wouldn't be ''preparation.''

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:00.200
I see why you left it blank. If you finish it,
it wouldn't be ''preparation.''

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:02.040
Sorry...

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:04.000
Where is your presentation?

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:06.590
Mine? Come with me.

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:10.510
It's her.

00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:11.260
It's her.

00:08:11.260 --> 00:08:12.340
It's her.

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:13.930
No!

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:19.390
Aren't you sleepy, Yuno?

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:22.060
Um, no, because I couldn't help but sleep.

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:24.520
But you must be tired.

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:26.900
I don't know.

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:30.360
But once I fall asleep,
I might be sound asleep until the morning.

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:32.320
So, it's over.

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:34.280
It's over.

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:38.200
It will be the same ordinary day
starting tomorrow.

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:40.660
I don't know how to put it, but...

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:44.500
I know how you feel. Your mind knows it,
but you heart doesn't want it.

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:48.590
I wish tomorrow was today.

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:53.800
Shoot, I guess I have to wake up
to reality right away.

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:57.140
Only your editor would fax you, right?

00:08:58.220 --> 00:09:01.180
Probably asking for the next script.

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:01.520
<i>Why haven't you...</i>

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:02.350
<i>...replied?</i>

00:09:02.350 --> 00:09:03.600
<i>I'll be going.</i>

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:07.730
She must be upset.

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:09.190
What is it?

00:09:09.190 --> 00:09:12.360
Ummm, I dunno.

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:13.940
Oh!

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:15.610
Turn, turn...

00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:17.910
Yunocchi, do it.

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:20.410
Do what?

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:22.370
Now, quickly, my lord.

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:24.160
Lord?!

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:27.920
''We're in the same boat.
Remember that, you swindler.''

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:31.210
No, that's a corrupt governor's line.

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:36.840
All right, guys. Over here, please.

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:37.010
All right, guys. Over here, please.

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:38.300
Yamabuki

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:41.430
Yamabuki Festival was really fun, wasn't it?

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:43.810
You don't want it to end just yet, do you?

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:46.480
I get it. Well then...

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:50.230
L-O-V-E, lovely Yoshinoya!

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:52.570
A new legend is born.

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:54.650
Yoshinoya on stage.

00:09:56.490 --> 00:10:00.370
Those who hurt people, take the
punishment of my syringe!

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:04.080
I wish I had one more day.

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:07.500
It's too late though.

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:09.460
You really worked hard.

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:12.040
But I couldn't finish in time.

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:16.050
You worked hard.
That's a fact, and we saw it.

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:20.640
You were so focused.
Did you even notice we visited your room?

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:22.300
What? When?

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:25.970
Every so often because we were concerned.

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:31.520
The Yunocchi support group was
gathered outside your place.

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:34.940
I see. Sorry for making you worry.

00:10:35.230 --> 00:10:36.900
It wasn't like that.

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:40.410
I wish I could have started earlier.

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:43.490
You did put a lot of thought into what
to do with your presentation.

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:46.040
Yeah, that took a lot of time.

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:50.460
The assignment didn't have any instruction.
Having no restrictions made it even harder.

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:52.540
I understand how you feel.

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:59.340
Thank you for everything. I was glad I had
someone I could ask for advice.

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:03.140
Well, I wish I could have given
some better advice.

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:04.510
Oh please, don't.

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:07.310
As for me, when Yunocchi
came to me for help,

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:11.230
I was able to decide what
to do with my project.

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:12.520
At that time?

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:16.980
Yeah, when I saw your indescribable
expression of confusion,

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:19.360
I thought I should save it as a picture.

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:22.030
That was so embarrassing.

00:11:22.860 --> 00:11:27.160
I also visited Ms. Yoshinoya, but...

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:28.790
Was she helpful?

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:31.080
The situation wasn't good.

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:35.290
She was scolded by the principal.

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:39.010
Seems like they had an argument
about her show.

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:41.220
That can't be helped.

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:47.890
This costume wasn't approved because
it was considered too sexy.

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:51.850
You guys are lucky to be able to see it. Now...

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:54.560
Let's dance!

00:11:56.560 --> 00:11:58.730
In the end, what made you decide
to draw that picture?

00:11:59.030 --> 00:12:02.740
Well, I remembered what Kishi said.

00:12:03.530 --> 00:12:09.410
Inspiration is everywhere, and what's
important is near me too.

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:12.160
I realized that.

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:17.040
Is that...

00:12:22.920 --> 00:12:27.050
Even if I wasn't allowed, I can throw
an improvised concert, right?

00:12:33.060 --> 00:12:38.060
My mind went blank because I couldn't
remember my line no matter what.

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:42.740
Everyone covered it so well that
it didn't disrupt the flow.

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:46.200
''If I can't show my back,
I just have to lie on the back.''

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:48.240
Now it comes out of my mouth so easily.

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:49.660
It happens.

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:53.870
It's not quite a walking distance, is it?

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:55.920
Yeah, it's just down there.

00:12:55.920 --> 00:13:00.210
Sorry, I thought I could relieve your fatigue,
but it is far, isn't it?

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:06.470
Not really. I'm glad I can go with you all.
I wasn't doing anything, anyway.

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:11.640
Me neither. Suddenly, it became
too quiet after we had split up.

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:13.390
Same here.

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:19.980
Oh, could that be it?

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:22.110
Yeah, I can see it.

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:23.740
I do, too.

00:13:25.610 --> 00:13:28.280
Wow, a chimney. That's pretty.

00:13:28.490 --> 00:13:29.660
Shou no Yu?

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:31.120
It's Masa no Yu.

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:34.870
It's a traditional bathhouse.
It's got a nice feel to it.

00:13:36.210 --> 00:13:37.790
Her Highness Yuno

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:38.000
Her Highness Yuno
Yu No Sa Ma?!

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:39.500
Yu No Sa Ma?!

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:41.920
Gosh, are you a VIP?

00:13:43.460 --> 00:13:44.460
Good evening.

00:13:44.460 --> 00:13:45.970
Sorry for the noise.

00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:49.260
Thanks for coming. It's 400 yen.

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:51.470
Here.

00:13:53.470 --> 00:13:55.390
My precious 400 yen...

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:57.390
Thank you.

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:01.310
And this is my last 100 yen.

00:14:02.770 --> 00:14:04.820
Now, I'm gonna chug.

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:06.860
Before taking the bath?

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:08.740
Here I go...

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:13.160
<i>SLOWLY</i>

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:20.420
Whoo-hoo, the bath!

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:22.340
Miya, wait!

00:14:24.460 --> 00:14:28.170
Wow, amazing. It's a bathhouse
right out of the picture.

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:30.970
The tub is so huge.

00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:33.350
I wonder if I can use these seats?

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:36.600
I think you can.
Are you gonna wash your body first?

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:39.310
No Miya, it's gonna be a mess.

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:41.520
Now, your turn.

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:49.530
It warms me up to my bones.
This feels so good.

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:52.990
Isn't it nice to be able to sink in
to the shoulders?

00:14:53.320 --> 00:14:55.120
Yeah, totally.

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:00.710
I can't sit.

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:06.090
So, the wall is really painted with Mount Fuji.

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:09.220
It depends on the bathhouse,
but it's standard.

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:13.680
I would draw a picture of a heavily
snow-covered mountain.

00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:15.310
Why?

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:19.350
Because you can appreciate the
warmth of the hot water.

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:21.270
I see.

00:15:21.270 --> 00:15:23.690
I'd choose Renoir's picture.

00:15:24.560 --> 00:15:27.070
It doesn't seem to go well.

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:29.780
Women look more attractive
with an ample body.

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:33.200
Scrub, scrub...

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:36.030
You look so happy.

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:40.370
''Oh, so you've made it here.
I shall commend you.''

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:43.210
What's that from?

00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:44.920
I just wanted to say it for no reason.

00:15:46.790 --> 00:15:49.510
So, you start with your hair?

00:15:49.670 --> 00:15:51.300
Yeah, I do.

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:57.680
You close your eyes like an
elementary school kid.

00:15:58.720 --> 00:16:01.140
Well, 'cause the shampoo
might get in my eyes.

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:05.150
The Yamabuki Festival was great.

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:08.820
Right. I wonder which class was most popular?

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:12.900
Probably a haunted house one
of the senior classes did.

00:16:13.240 --> 00:16:16.950
Hey, why does Dracula hate garlic?

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:18.950
What's the matter all of a sudden?

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:20.620
Well, it's just...

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:22.500
Probably because it stinks.

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:23.830
Is that it?

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:26.630
His nose must be sensitive like a dog.

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:29.880
That makes sense.
He transforms into a wolf too.

00:16:30.170 --> 00:16:33.800
What? Dracula turns into a bat, doesn't he?

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:36.050
He can become a wolf too, I think.

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:37.640
Are you sure?

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:39.850
Dracula has to be a bat.

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:41.810
I think he can also take the shape of a wolf.

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:43.640
It's a bat, Sae.

00:16:43.890 --> 00:16:45.900
Oh well, whatever.

00:16:49.520 --> 00:16:51.150
Yuno...

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:54.530
Miyacchi?!

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:58.030
Yuno, you have a towel around you.
Are you embarrassed?

00:16:58.320 --> 00:17:03.580
Ah, yes. I'm an only child,
so I'm not used to bathing with others.

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:08.080
I see. I used to bathe with my younger
sister, so I guess I'm used to it.

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:12.710
I wish I had a brother like you, Sae.

00:17:12.960 --> 00:17:14.590
A brother?

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:18.800
I felt like the event was long, but also short.

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:22.180
There were some rough times,
but all our hard work paid off.

00:17:23.220 --> 00:17:24.850
I did my very best.

00:17:24.850 --> 00:17:28.860
I couldn't do my best.

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:33.030
Are you talking about your drawing?
But you're going to finish it, right?

00:17:33.230 --> 00:17:36.110
Yes. Will you want to take a
look when it's finished?

00:17:36.240 --> 00:17:37.610
Of course.

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:39.950
Hey, what did the principal do?

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:42.990
I saw him for a little bit, but...

00:17:42.990 --> 00:17:45.000
The principal didn't have any
presentations, did he?

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:47.670
I was looking forward to it a little.

00:17:48.120 --> 00:17:50.000
He might start making one from now on.

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:53.340
Like a ''bent'' statue of Ms. Yoshinoya.

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:56.630
No, that sounds too poisonous.
I can't say it out loud.

00:17:56.880 --> 00:17:58.380
Time out!

00:17:58.380 --> 00:18:00.050
Miya?!

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:01.720
The fan, probably.

00:18:01.720 --> 00:18:06.600
Speaking of presentations, did you see
the picture of lavender? I liked it.

00:18:06.890 --> 00:18:11.860
Oh, when I saw it I thought you'd like it.

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:18.360
What really amazed me was a senior
student's 4 meter tall...

00:18:18.860 --> 00:18:20.280
Swamp monster!

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:24.990
That was impressive.
But why did it have to be a swamp monster?

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:30.670
Apparently, he wanted to make a mermaid,
but it was hard to balance the design,

00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:32.290
so he ended up with a swamp monster.

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:35.630
That's all it was?

00:18:36.050 --> 00:18:40.760
As for plays, we did our own,
and saw yours. That was it.

00:18:42.550 --> 00:18:44.180
Welcome back.

00:18:44.260 --> 00:18:47.020
I can feel my cooled body warming up.

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:49.850
Hey, Miya, would you do the horse again?

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:53.770
I don't wanna sell myself cheap.

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:56.940
Did Miya's horse surprise you?

00:18:56.940 --> 00:18:58.780
Yeah, totally.

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:04.870
I know it.
I was so surprised when I first heard it.

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:09.960
This pumpkin's gonna be your coach.
You can attend the ball.

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:10.580
Horse

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:10.580
Miyako

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:10.580
Cinderella

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:10.580
Pumpkin Coach

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:10.580
Witch

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:10.580
How nice! Thank you, madam.

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:12.210
How nice! Thank you, madam.

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:14.630
A girl is playing a horse?

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:18.260
Perhaps they should have built
one just like the pumpkin.

00:19:21.840 --> 00:19:23.470
That's awesome.

00:19:25.100 --> 00:19:27.640
Your one voice stole the audience's attention.

00:19:27.850 --> 00:19:29.850
You also stood out, Yuno.

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:31.480
Well, but I was...

00:19:31.770 --> 00:19:34.810
It was Cinderella by Art Department 1-A.

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:39.360
Oh no, it's too heavy. Hey, light person,
help me. I can't close the curtain.

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:40.950
Right away!

00:19:44.820 --> 00:19:47.700
I didn't want to get anyone's attention though.

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:49.660
Take this.

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:53.210
You meanie. All right, then...

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:55.540
Oh, a counterattack?

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:57.300
Yah, yah...

00:20:02.630 --> 00:20:06.510
There was something I didn't
like during your play.

00:20:07.430 --> 00:20:09.810
It's not about you or your classmates,

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:13.940
but someone who sat next to me
kept eating on and on.

00:20:14.100 --> 00:20:15.350
Roast squid, wasn't it?

00:20:15.350 --> 00:20:16.860
How did you know?

00:20:16.860 --> 00:20:18.570
It sounded like it.

00:20:18.570 --> 00:20:23.650
Probably so, but we couldn't
tell because it was dark.

00:20:23.650 --> 00:20:28.120
Started with a roasted squid, then yakisoba
noodles, followed by a Döner kebab.

00:20:28.530 --> 00:20:30.370
The last was a fried pork chop bowl.

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:33.540
Oh, the smell told me that was a pork bowl.

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:36.500
How did he eat that much?

00:20:36.710 --> 00:20:41.300
I wish I had a pork bowl, too. I should have
got there first thing in the morning.

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:45.010
It was a limited serving of thirty.

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:49.810
I heard that 1-B's cake was great, but by
the time I got there, it was gone.

00:20:50.060 --> 00:20:53.310
I'll ask someone in 1-B
about its recipe tomorrow.

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:57.560
Sounds good. Make sure you treat us.

00:20:58.310 --> 00:21:01.480
Phew... I'm gonna take a break.

00:21:03.900 --> 00:21:05.400
That was a good bath.

00:21:05.400 --> 00:21:07.030
I feel dizzy.

00:21:07.030 --> 00:21:07.950
Did you dry well?

00:21:07.950 --> 00:21:09.030
I did!
Did you dry well?

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:17.500
No, my triceps...

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:19.710
Hiro, you're not fat at all.

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:21.340
I am.

00:21:23.630 --> 00:21:26.720
This mirror reminds me of a ballet lesson.

00:21:27.010 --> 00:21:29.970
Oh yeah, the one with a bar.

00:21:30.510 --> 00:21:32.140
Oh my...

00:21:33.100 --> 00:21:34.480
Hidamari Apartments

00:21:34.850 --> 00:21:36.100
Well, goodnight.

00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:37.770
Goodnight.

00:21:43.150 --> 00:21:46.110
I left my place when I was
heating the water.

00:21:47.490 --> 00:21:51.030
It's hot. It'll be cold by tomorrow obviously.

00:21:51.160 --> 00:21:52.740
I don't want to waste it.

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:55.290
I'm gonna be sleeping like a baby tonight.

00:21:59.540 --> 00:22:06.550
I should sleep well tonight.

00:22:06.760 --> 00:22:07.970
End of November 3rd

00:22:08.050 --> 00:22:08.630
To Be Continued

