Mebae Drive

00:23:05.070 --> 00:23:09.530
Hashire sky hadashi no mama

00:23:09.530 --> 00:23:13.740
Hora me wo tsubutte utsuridashuta

00:23:13.740 --> 00:23:16.910
Niji no hashi e yukou

00:23:16.910 --> 00:23:18.580
Mebae Drive

00:23:18.580 --> 00:23:22.920
