00:23:22.920 --> 00:23:31.130
Sora ni chiribame ochiteku
hitokakera no yume wo

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:38.850
Te ni tsukanda hikari wo

00:23:38.890 --> 00:23:58.950
Next Episode

00:23:41.270 --> 00:23:43.730
What do you like for lunch?

00:23:43.730 --> 00:23:44.940
I like fried egg!

00:23:44.940 --> 00:23:46.610
I like sausages!

00:23:46.730 --> 00:23:48.110
You make them look like crabs and octopi.

00:23:48.110 --> 00:23:50.110
We had rolled sushi for special events.

00:23:50.110 --> 00:23:53.070
Triangle, triangle, occasionally circle.
Another circle inside.

00:23:53.070 --> 00:23:54.700
I got it. They're rice balls, aren't they?

00:23:54.700 --> 00:23:58.830
It will be fun. Make sure you have everything
you need, and don't be late.

00:23:59.080 --> 00:24:03.040
Next time is
"April 28th: A Round Cabbage''

00:24:03.040 --> 00:24:06.540
We'll be waiting at Yamabuki High,
so please, join us again.
